  "claim": "Lucy Alexis Liu stars as Dr. Joan Watson in the show that the narrator of the UK version of \"Journey to the Edge of the Universe\" played Inspector Lestrade in. The show is an American procedural drama series from 2012.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Elementary (TV series). Sentence: Elementary is an American procedural drama series that presents a contemporary update of Sir Arthur Conan Doyle's character Sherlock Holmes.\nPage: Elementary (TV series). Sentence: The series was created by Robert Doherty and stars Jonny Lee Miller as Sherlock Holmes and Lucy Liu as Dr. Joan Watson.\nPage: Lucy Liu. Sentence: Lucy Alexis Liu (born Lucy Liu; December 2, 1968) is an American actress, voice actress, director, producer, singer and artist.\nPage: Sean Pertwee. Sentence: Pertwee has played Captain Fitzpatrick in the play \"Tom Jones\", Sergeant Wells in \"Dog Soldiers\", Pilot Smith in \"Event Horizon\", Inspector Lestrade in CBS's \"Elementary\" and Alfred Pennyworth in Fox's \"Gotham\".\nPage: Journey to the Edge of the Universe. Sentence: The US edition was narrated by Alec Baldwin and the UK edition by Sean Pertwee.",
